1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 28=

5
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:11,960
Oh, that felt good.

6
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:14,199
Zhao Song's finally out of S&D.

7
00:00:26,719 --> 00:00:27,120
Look.

8
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,679
(S&D's rising designer, Lin Hua,)

9
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,119
(secretly married
Xie Group's head, Xie Zhouhan)

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,759
(Lin Hua used the Xies to get ahead.)

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,159
- (Xie Zhouhan, Lin Hua)
- Bad news.

12
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,439
(Secret marriage exposed.)

13
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,679
(A rising star in design?)

14
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:45,520
(Just Mrs. Xie padding her resume.)

15
00:00:45,679 --> 00:00:47,000
They're disgusting.

16
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:49,200
You just proved you didn't plagiarize.

17
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,320
Now they're going after your marriage.

18
00:00:58,039 --> 00:00:58,759
I'll take a look.

19
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:10,640
Hua,

20
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:11,719
I came to get you.

21
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:13,439
What's wrong?

22
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:14,760
Where are we going?

23
00:01:15,359 --> 00:01:15,840
Home.

24
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,879
Reporters will be
swarming this place soon.

25
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,680
♪Look, the world has lost its color♪

26
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,120
Hua,

27
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:26,799
I want us

28
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,599
to face this whole mess together.

29
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,280
Will you let me?

30
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,400
♪It hurts to breathe♪

31
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:34,879
Yes.

32
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,719
This is outrageous.

33
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:40,959
They're saying Mommy
used Dad to get ahead.

34
00:01:43,879 --> 00:01:44,319
Seriously?

35
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:47,879
Do they even know a genius architect
when they see one?

36
00:01:55,319 --> 00:01:56,319
Mommy,

37
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,760
don't look at your phone.

38
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,359
They're just making things up.

39
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,480
I'm fine.

40
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,120
There are two ways to handle this.

41
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:04,719
One,

42
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,120
Xie Group and S&D
issue a joint statement

43
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:09,560
confirming Lin Hua was hired properly.

44
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,080
Your marriage is a private matter.

45
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:12,240
No further comment.

46
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,280
Two,

47
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:16,439
you announce your marriage

48
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:17,520
and release

49
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:19,280
all of Lin Hua's work on the project.

50
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:21,639
Take your time.

51
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,280
Whether to go public

52
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:24,879
is up to you.

53
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,879
If I don't go public,

54
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:35,000
they'll say

55
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,159
you're pulling strings for me.

56
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,319
If I do,

57
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,000
they'll say

58
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,439
I married you for my career.

59
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,280
So what now?

60
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,800
I'll go public.

61
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,520
But this time,

62
00:02:58,319 --> 00:02:59,879
I don't need Xie Zhouhan to defend me.

63
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,159
I'll speak for myself.

64
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,360
Are you sure?

65
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,719
I didn't want to go public

66
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,280
for fear of living in your shadow.

67
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,400
But now I get it.

68
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,800
What's mine is still mine.

69
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,919
Being your wife won't erase that.

70
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,759
I won't keep you waiting behind me.

71
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,280
(They're here!)

72
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:54,000
(They're out!)

73
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:54,800
Ms. Lin,

74
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,199
What's your relationship
with Xie Group's

75
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,039
Xie Zhouhan?

76
00:03:57,159 --> 00:03:59,199
Did you hide your marriage
to cover up a deal?

77
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,719
Are you still romantically involved

78
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,879
with Gu Group's Gu Zheng?

79
00:04:02,039 --> 00:04:02,800
- (Yes!)
- (Tell us!)

80
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,000
- (Any comment?)
- (Ms. Lin!)

81
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,560
I...

82
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,120
(Mr. Xie's here!)

83
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,000
(Mr. Xie's here!)

84
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:08,000
(Quick!)

85
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,680
(Keep up!)

86
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,800
(Mr. Xie!)

87
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:24,680
(Any comment?)

88
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,759
(Over here, Mr. Xie!)

89
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:26,360
(Mr. Xie,)

90
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,439
(can you confirm)

91
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,759
(your marriage to Ms. Lin?)

92
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,360
(Mr. Xie,)

93
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,000
(are you really married to Ms. Lin?)

94
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:33,199
Mr. Xie, how long have you been married?

95
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,240
Well, we...

96
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:35,800
Zhouhan,

97
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,000
let me.

98
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,160
I am married.

99
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:53,079
My husband

100
00:04:54,199 --> 00:04:55,040
is Xie Zhouhan.

101
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,279
So are you admitting

102
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:58,560
the Xies got you your job at S&D?

103
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:00,680
I said I'm married,

104
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,560
not that those rumors are true.

105
00:05:03,439 --> 00:05:04,600
I got into S&D

106
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,600
through its open recruitment process.

107
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,439
My proposal passed the review

108
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:10,040
because of my design skills.

109
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:12,319
I didn't marry my way up.

110
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,160
And it's no excuse to attack me.

111
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:16,199
Mr. Xie, any comment?

112
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,600
My wife's work

113
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:19,319
stands on its own.

114
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:21,600
I'm so proud

115
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:24,079
of my wife.

116
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:29,759
Zheng,

117
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,600
I wasn't the only one

118
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,720
behind what happened online.

119
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,040
Zhao Song contacted me first.

120
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:37,319
I just went along with it.

121
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:39,879
I was just afraid of losing you.

122
00:05:41,399 --> 00:05:41,959
Sirong,

123
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,920
you've gone too far.

124
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:45,959
Mrs. Wen,

125
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:48,600
Lin Hua's fine, isn't she?

126
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:51,560
She's even announced she's Mrs. Xie.

127
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:53,399
My sister's the one who lost out.

128
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,360
Shut up.

129
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,600
Zheng...

130
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:01,040
I just spoke to your family.

131
00:06:01,439 --> 00:06:02,439
The engagement is off.

132
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,360
Mr. Gu.

133
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,879
We may marry for business,

134
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:07,879
but we won't take in someone like you,

135
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:10,519
who schemes and ruins people's careers.

136
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:12,000
Mr. Gu!

137
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:15,079
Zheng, say something for me!

138
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,720
You can't just leave me!

139
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:17,519
Zheng!

140
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:18,879
Zheng!

141
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:20,480
- Zheng!
- Li Sirong.

142
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:22,040
It's over.

143
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,120
What?

144
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,600
It's over?

145
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:32,800
So,

146
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:37,319
you never really accepted me.

147
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,480
You were engaged to me,

148
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,399
but you never got over Lin Hua.

149
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,399
It's my fault.

150
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,759
I shouldn't have chosen you for money

151
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,240
or kept hurting her

152
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:52,839
after choosing you.

153
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:55,839
But my mistakes

154
00:06:56,439 --> 00:06:57,560
don't excuse what you've done.

155
00:06:59,000 --> 00:06:59,519
Go.

156
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,439
I don't want to see you again.

157
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,399
Sirong.

158
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:07,079
It's okay.

159
00:07:07,399 --> 00:07:08,079
It's over now.

160
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:10,680
Don't cry.

161
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,759
You didn't lose to Xie Zhouhan.

162
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:15,519
You did this to yourself.

163
00:07:37,066 --> 00:07:38,200
♪You say you♪

164
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,700
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

165
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:43,240
♪You're just fine on your own♪

166
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:46,600
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

167
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:49,440
♪And the pain you face at night♪

168
00:07:50,450 --> 00:07:53,400
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

169
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:56,520
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

170
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:59,600
♪Some love needs no promises♪

171
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,680
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

172
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:05,800
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

173
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:08,720
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

174
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,880
♪I'm right behind you♪

175
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:15,240
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

176
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:18,200
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

177
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:21,800
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

178
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:28,140
♪I'm right behind you♪

179
00:08:28,350 --> 00:08:29,940
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

180
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:31,740
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

181
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:34,540
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

182
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:35,980
♪I'm right behind you♪

183
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:38,460
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

184
00:08:38,460 --> 00:08:40,050
♪I won't claim you♪

185
00:08:40,050 --> 00:08:41,740
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

186
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:44,540
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

187
00:08:45,363 --> 00:08:47,660
♪Waiting for you♪
